{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO THE INTERVIEW.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have entered an official testing sector of the <strong>AEON DIRECTIVE</strong>, the system that decides who may enter <i>The Building</i>,\u00a0humanity\u2019s final refuge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 questions will determine your <strong>compliance</strong> and <strong>perception</strong>.<br>You may answer only <strong>YES</strong> or <strong>NO</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the test does not end with your answers.<br>After each question, <strong>something may change.</strong><br>Objects shift. The room distorts. Reality becomes unstable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When an <strong>anomaly</strong> occurs,\u00a0<strong>stop answering.</strong><br>Choose <strong>RECALIBRATE</strong> to realign the system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fail to recalibrate, and the test will lower your <strong>perception score</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>50 BINARY QUESTIONS</strong>:\u00a0A psychological evaluation that shapes your compliance profile. <br>\u2022 <strong>ANOMALY SYSTEM</strong>:\u00a0The world changes after each question. Observe or perish. <br>\u2022 <strong>KEYCARD ACCESS TIERS</strong>: Four levels, marked by card suits. Each tier unlocks new rooms \u2014 and new risks. <br>\u2022 <strong>PERMADEATH</strong>:\u00a0One continuous evaluation. Failing compliance or perception leads to permanent removal. <br>\u2022 <strong>MULTIPLE ENDINGS</strong>:\u00a0 Depending on your performance, you may be erased, reprogrammed, or accepted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do not answer without certainty.</strong><br><strong>Do not ignore change.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The system sees more than you do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4119840?t=1761602337","b